---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { marked } from "marked";

const content = `# Privacy Policy

*Last updated: November 2026*

## Data Collection

rafifmsn/tool operates in your browser without user accounts or client-side analytics scripts. We do not collect personal information, set tracking cookies, or track your activity across websites.

## Local Storage & Databases

Some tools may use your browser's local storage or IndexedDB to persist your preferences, project states, or work-in-progress data. This application data is stored entirely on your device and never leaves your browser.

## Hosting & Third-Party Services

This website is served as a static site through Cloudflare (DNS, CDN, and Workers). Like most web infrastructure, Cloudflare processes standard HTTP request metadata at the edge to deliver pages, mitigate abuse, and provide aggregate traffic metrics. Some tools also load open-source libraries (such as KaTeX and QRCode) from cdnjs.cloudflare.com. No invasive third-party tracking scripts or profiling data processors are used.

## Changes

We may update this policy occasionally. Any changes will be posted on this page.

## Contact

For inquiries regarding this Privacy Policy, submit a request through our [Contact Form](https://go.rafifmsn.com/contact-form).
`;

const html = marked(content);
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy - Rafif Muchsin" description="Privacy policy for Tool." topbarTitle="Privacy Policy">
  <article class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 lg:py-12 prose">
    <Fragment set:html={html} />
  </article>
</BaseLayout>